Bundle-Name: Event Atlas Model Inference
Bundle-Description: Turns a collected payload sample set into a reviewed model draft: \
 de-duplicates by sample-set fingerprint, rate limits, composes one prompt and runs a \
 single agentic chat completion whose tools author, validate and publish the package \
 elsewhere - so what comes back here is a receipt, never a metamodel document. Carries no \
 EMF dependency at all, which is what makes "never registers an inferred package locally" \
 a property of the bundle rather than a promise.

-workingset: SensiNact

-buildpath: \
	org.eclipse.fennec.event.atlas.southbound.common;version=snapshot,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.event.atlas.southbound.sampling;version=snapshot
